WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:08.800
Right!

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:09.926
Let's go, let's go, let's go! 

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.514
Are you sure you don't 
want to just shave it all off?

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.140
Uh...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:15.640
Shave your head.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.433
- Get rid of it. 
- No

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:16.975
No?

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:17.976
Okay, well I'm going to keep checking back. 

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.437
How have things been with the children?

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:21.646
Ah, we adore them both. 

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.856
Princess is a...

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.774
four foot seven inch

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:25.442
ball of energy. 

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.443
Ha, ha. 

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.903
Oh, my god. Do they have 
the faces of angels. 

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:29.988
I bet they have the faces of angels. 

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:30.989
-Yeah.
-Do they totally love you?

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.115
Yeah, I bet they totally love you

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:32.782
don't they. 

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.701
Still haven't bonded properly with them. 

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.994
Who wants to put up a tent?

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.037
I'm not fun enough.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.164
Where's Princess gone? Princess?

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.458
You never do anything by the book 
and it always works out. 

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:43.585
I do everything by the book 
and it never works out. 

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:45.795
Oh, my god. Did I buy 
the wrong bloody book?

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:49.883
I cannot believe

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.967
that he supports

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:51.843
Arsenal.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:52.886
I don't belong here. 

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.179
Well, he's young. 
Switch him to Spurs. 

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:55.221
He's already set. 

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.266
And anyway I'd rather he was an Arsenal fan 
than someone who switches teams.

00:00:58.266 --> 00:00:59.017
I mean that's like

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.226
cheating on your wife. 

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:02.312
Sorry, mate. No offense. 

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:04.898
You're selling our flat?

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:05.940
Your tenancy runs out

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:06.566
in three months.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.442
It's only a few weeks until

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:08.401
we go before the judge.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.320
Does that mean we're going 
to lose custody of the kids?

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.905
The council wants stable families.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:12.947
What, what are we gonna do?

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.533
♫

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:16.493
Everything is going to be okay.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.869
I mean, how do we know that

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.537
they even want to stay with us?

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:20.705
Because we have

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:21.664
a good

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:22.248
love.

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:24.000
One that can survive life.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.376
♫ 

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:28.546
Ahhh!

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:32.467
♫ 

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.054
♫ 

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:37.889
Love doesn't just happen to you.

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:39.182
It's hard work.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.725
If you want it,

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:42.101
You find it.

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:43.686
Whooo!

00:01:43.686 --> 00:01:44.938
Oh, yeah!

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.689
You're not being me, are you?

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:49.442
To do that you need to fully 
understand my, um,

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:53.071
philosophy of life.

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.656
You rarely hear a phrase like that,

00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:57.200
coming from someone eating
 two children's yogurts.

